  "note": "Two hexagonal windows of neighboring AB-stacked graphite sheets, derived from the neutron-diffraction cell of COD 9011577 (a = 2.464 \u00c5, c = 6.711 \u00c5). Their plane separation is c/2 = 0.33555 nm; the catalog value is the approximate 0.335 nm. The neutral connector measures plane to plane. Colored tubes trace nuclear positions and bonds; their thickness and colors are illustrative. These are tiny windows into extended sheets, not isolated benzene molecules, and the gap is not the thickness of a single graphene sheet.",
